; MITEMSHUB AI v26.16 — Crash 1000 CRASH/BOOM profile (FADE-ONLY)
; Values current as of v26.15/26.16 (fade TP 3.2xATR, Quick-TP off); header refreshed 2026-09-01
; Optimized for Crash 1000 Index on M5 timeframe
; Generated 2026-08-28 from 60-day optimization sweep
;
; Crash 1000 characteristics:
;   - Frequent small spikes (median 7.88pts, mean 8.97pts)
;   - Spikes go DOWN against the grind
;   - Post-spike fade = BUY opportunity (mirror of Boom)
;   - Spike freq: ~37/day (~1 per 39min)
;   - Best entry: after spike retrace 30-70%
;
; Strategy: POST-SPIKE FADE ONLY (v25) — grind disabled
; TP=3.5xATR optimized from 60-day sweep (was 1.8, PF 3.68 expR +1.83)
; Risk: Conservative (0.30% per trade, scales with spike probability)
; Magic: 7788300 - fleet exposure guard compliant
;
; v25 Intelligence Layers:
;   1. SpikeDetector - tick speed + candle body analysis
;   2. TickPatternAnalyzer - individual tick precursor scoring
;   3. MultiTimeframeConfirm - M1+M5+M15 agreement required
;   4. TimeOfDayAwareness - learns dangerous hours live
;   5. SymbolCalibration - auto-detects Crash 1000 parameters
;   6. DynamicRiskSizing - reduces lot during high spike prob
;   7. CrashBoomStrategy - POST-SPIKE FADE ONLY

